# Must never be published: this repository is public and the audit lists
# defects, including ones not fixed yet (`dev/WORKFLOW.md`, "Files that
# must stay untracked"). Ignored rather than merely untracked, because
# "untracked" survives exactly until someone types `git add -A` — which
# is how both of these once reached a public commit.
/AUDIT.md
/.idea/

# Built canary probes: rebuilt from source and re-accepted per run;
# a stale committed binary would be measured instead of the code beside it.
bench-external/canary/pair_canary
